<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Lamma</book>
  <para style="h">Filimon</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bulus Sekoo Yɛnɛ FILIMON Bi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filimon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fil</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bulus Sekoo Yɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">FILIMON BI</para>
  <para style="imt">Yutasinɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Filimon sipɛ Kirisa pɛ̃niba, u a tete shɔ wɛrɛ Ɗa a kolosa uko sã foo au shɔ ɓau nii nɛ Onisimus rɛ. Foom yuu au shɔwɛrɛ ɗɔbiini a kpaazɔrɛ a Bulus ni a ɗaa au si jahm yɛ. A Bulus kabiikɔ Onisimus rii Kirisa rɛ.<char style="bk">Bulus sẽkoo yɛnɛ Filimon</char> bi pɛ gakinɛ aru Filimon u ntɔriu ɔ̃nɛ au foo, gbete Bulus sɔriu ɗobii, u tɛunaatɔ ɓa naa foo toti ɓa ama naa ɓɛzɔ̃ Kirisa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Vi au Ɓuzɨn yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Yutasinɛ (1-3)</para>
  <para style="io1">Shɔ Bɛli Filimon (4-7)</para>
  <para style="io1">Onisimus gakinɛ (8-22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yisinɛ (23-25)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Sẽkoom shɛ ang naa Bulus, shɔgbete n a jahm aru Kirisi Yesɔ, a Timoti u ɓɛzɔ̃ u aɗɔn a nkɔng ni,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">N bee sẽkoom yɛnɛ u ɓɛsa Filimon u shɔvi shonɛ au ɗɔbii, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />a Afiya u ɓɛnaa a Arikibu u ɓɛzɔ̃ vishonɛ sisɨn ãnɛ, a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ ai gɨn Yesɔ shɔgbeteyi toli au wɛrɛyɛ.<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Mɛnɛ Ɗalapa Uɓeye a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi u ãwɔ ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ a ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛni.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filimon Ɔrinɛ a Sisɨn Ãnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Mazɔ̃ Filimon, ko-piɗaviya n kɛ gaki Ɗa nɛ n ɓaa niitɔ n dɔ̃rin Ɗalaparɛ. <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />Aruviya n ntawɔ ɔrinɛtɛ piti kpai a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyini a sisɨn ãnɛ gbete ɔ awuni au Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ nii ni. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />N gakinɛ au yuɓasinɛ a mɔkɔni a nyaba shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ, yɛ n-tiu vitɔ̃vɨng zɛnɛtɔ fɛ̃ɛm shɔgbete u a wuniyɛ au ɔ̃nɛ aka yuɓasinɛ a Kirisini. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Mazɔ̃, a ɔrinɛ n ting sisɨn purutɛ fɛ̃ɛm a bimanɛni! Aruviya pɔ̃ Ɗalapa shɔbiiyitɛ i sisɨn lakitɛ fɛ̃ɛm.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus Gaki Aru Onisimus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Aru nankɔ n yɛn zɛa nɔɔ nyanwarinɛtɔ a kakani a pɛ mazɔ̃ a Kirisi kabii, n pɔ̃arɛ a pɛli vigbete tɔ̃rɛ shɔu pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />Ama aru n Bulus n ɔraatɔ, n kasirɛ n gakaatɔ, a Kirisi Yesɔ ɗekɨn, gbete shɔ mang a jahm au yuuyɛ. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />N gakaatɔ a majaa Onisimu yuu shɔgbete u pɛ n jaa a Kirisi kabii; aruviya aɗagbete n si a jahm nkɔng si pɛ uɓeye a suru. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />A ɗauni siu vishonɛ ɓa aa ɗɔbiini ɓa ama dɔdɔrim u vishonɛ aa ɗɔbiini a nkɔni.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />N sho Onisimu sɔ̃ntɛ yɛnɛ aa ɗɔbii dɔdɔrim, ukɔ shɔgbete n ɔriyɛ ang sisɨn fɛ̃ɛm. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Aɗagbete n si a jahm aru ruu tɔ̃vɨn nwanɛ n kasirɛ n sãu ang ɗɔbii, nɔgbete u pɔ̃sinnaa a yuu vishonɛni. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />N ji kasi ɓa n pɔ̃ a kaka bi aru a pɔ̃sinnaa rɛ ɓa; ama vigbete a kasi pɛlinyɛ u ɔ̃ jo aa tete tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ, ɓanɛ n pɔ̃a kaka ɓa.<verse eid="PHM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Yɛ ɔ̃rɛ si Onisimu yaa a ɗɔbiitɛ sekaa aru a yɛ tɛurɛ a ɔ̃ awuni dangdang. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />U vishonɛ ang ɗɔbiini pɛ̃nɛɓa, nagbete u vishonɛ yɛ ɔ̃ sɔ̃njo aa ɗɔbiini pɛ̃nɛɓa naa jaa foo, naa a mɛzɔ̃ a uɓeyelapa kabii! <verse eid="PHM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Aru nankɔ nkɛ ɔ̃nɛ a wesa vishonɛni, a tɛu naa kaziti nagbete asi tɛnyɛ. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Naa Onisimu pɛlaa vikɔ̃linɛ nɛ ko ɔ gɨu viwɔ, a gɨnkɛ nkɔ. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Nkɔng Bulus n bee ang yuu n yɛn shootɔ. Ama mɔkaa sukinɛ apɛ n makɔ jo, <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Aru nankɔ mazɔ̃, n gakaatɔ a pɛlin shonɛ tɔ̃vɨnmitɔ aru Uɓeyelapa; aru u pɛ ɓɛzɔ̃ a ka Kirisi, pɔ̃mpɛ n ntabiinyatɔ̃nɛtɔǃ<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />N zɛtɛ a yɛ gɨn n nyatɔ, n zɛtɛttɔ a yɛ pɛli vigbete tɛ namtɔ aruukɔ n bee kɨn. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />sɔ̃n tɔti, n kasirɛ a kɔrin jaa gbete n roo a ɗɔntɔ, aruviya n pɔ̃ a sisɨn Ɗalapa yɛ kasaa gakinɛtɔ u pɔ̃rɛ shɔu yannaa a jahɨm a sɔn ɗɔbii.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyageenɛ Dangdang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Abafara shɔgbeteu a jahm a nkɔni aru Kirisi Yesɔ yuu gee ɔ nyatɛjo, <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />sɔ̃nji nankɔ Markusi, a Aristaku, a Dema, a Luka i piti kpai n shɔ vishonɛyi i gee ɔ nyatɛ.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Mɛnɛ Uɓeyelapa Kirisi Yesɔ tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ u ɔ̃ a ɔkɔɔni piti kpai.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>